<div class="panel">
  <div class="topline">
    <h1>🏆 {{ t('Alpha leaders', '阿尔法领先股') }}</h1>
    <span class="muted sm">{{ t('sector-neutral residual momentum across the S&P 1500 · winners within their sector', '板普 1500 的板块中性残差动量 · 各板块内的领先股') }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="muted sm note">{{ t(
    "The durable form of the operator's idea: strip each stock's market AND sector beta, then rank the residual ('alpha') information ratio WITHIN its GICS sector over a 12-1-month window. The entry tag flags a leader that ran hot (extended → reversal risk) vs one on a recent pullback (constructive). Validated on a deep 1962-2026 panel (research/RESIDUAL_ALPHA_MOMENTUM.md): residual is the modern-durable variant of momentum, but it's a modest, decayed, crowded edge — a research lens and context, NOT a buy list. Short-term reversal is an entry overlay, not the score; 'acceleration' was tested and dropped (anti-predictive).",
    "操作者想法的持久形式：剔除每只股票的市场与板块贝塔，再在其 GICS 板块内按 12-1 个月窗口对残差（“阿尔法”）信息比率排名。入场标签标示领先股是否过热（extended → 反转风险）或处于近期回调（constructive）。已在 1962-2026 深度样本验证（research/RESIDUAL_ALPHA_MOMENTUM.md）：残差是动量的现代持久变体，但属温和、已衰减、拥挤的边际信号——仅作研究视角与背景，并非买入清单。短期反转为入场叠加项而非评分；“加速度”经测试已剔除（反向预测）。") }}</p>
  <p class="muted sm" style="margin:6px 0 0">{{ t('As of', '截至') }} {{ as_of }} · {{ n }} {{ t('names', '只') }} ·
    {{ t('betas', '贝塔') }} {{ windows.beta_win }}d · {{ t('formation', '形成窗口') }} {{ windows.form }}-{{ windows.skip }}d</p>
</div>

<div class="tabs">
  <button class="tabbtn on" data-tab="global">{{ t('Global index', '全球指数') }}</button>
  <button class="tabbtn" data-tab="sectors">{{ t('Sectors', '板块') }}</button>
  <button class="tabbtn" data-tab="themes">{{ t('Themes', '主题') }}</button>
  <button class="tabbtn" data-tab="sector">{{ t('Sector index', '板块明细') }}</button>
</div>

<!-- GLOBAL INDEX -->
<div id="tab-global" data-grp="tab">
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="seg">
      <button class="segbtn on" id="seg-strong">{{ t('Strongest', '最强') }}</button>
      <button class="segbtn" id="seg-weak">{{ t('Weakest', '最弱') }}</button>
    </div>
    {% set thead %}
      <tr><th>#</th><th>{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th><th>{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('alpha z', '阿尔法 z') }}{{ help('Sector-neutral residual-momentum information ratio, winsorized to a cross-sectional z-score. Higher = stronger idiosyncratic (beta/sector-stripped) momentum within its GICS sector. This is the global, cross-sector-comparable score.', '板块中性残差动量信息比率的去极值横截面 z 分数。越高 = 在其 GICS 板块内的特质（剔除贝塔/板块）动量越强。此为可跨板块比较的全局评分。') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('entry', '入场') }}{{ help('Short-term reversal overlay (NOT the score): a leader that just ran hot is extended (reversal risk); one on a recent pullback is constructive. Laggards/neutral otherwise.', '短期反转叠加项（非评分）：刚刚过热的领先股为 extended（反转风险）；近期回调的为 constructive。') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('12-1 mom', '12-1 动量') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('sector #', '板块排名') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('RS', '相对强度') }}{{ help('Relative strength 1-99: cross-sectional percentile of the trailing 12-1 return (the familiar IBD-style rating). A recognizable but SHALLOWER momentum lens — subordinate context, NOT the alpha score (which also strips market AND sector beta). The 3m/6m/12m sub-percentiles show whether RS is improving or fading.', '相对强度 1-99：12-1 趋势回报的横截面百分位（熟悉的 IBD 风格评级）。一个易懂但更浅的动量视角——从属背景，并非阿尔法评分（后者还剔除了市场与板块贝塔）。3/6/12 月分项显示 RS 在改善还是衰退。') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('price', '价格') }}</th></tr>
    {% endset %}
    <div id="g-strong" data-grp="glist">
      <table>{{ thead }}{% for r in strongest %}{{ grow(r, loop.index) }}{% endfor %}</table>
    </div>
    <div id="g-weak" data-grp="glist" style="display:none">
      <table>{{ thead }}{% for r in weakest %}{{ grow(r, loop.index) }}{% endfor %}</table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SECTORS OVERVIEW -->
<div id="tab-sectors" data-grp="tab" style="display:none">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('Sectors by alpha', '按阿尔法排序的板块') }}
      {{ help('GICS sectors ranked by the mean sector-neutral alpha of their names, with the share of each sector sitting in the universe-wide top quintile. Because the score is sector-neutral, this measures how broadly a sector is leading, not the sector ETF return.', '按其成分股的平均板块中性阿尔法对 GICS 板块排序，并显示各板块处于全域顶部五分位的占比。由于评分为板块中性，这衡量的是板块领先的广度，而非板块 ETF 回报。') }}</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>#</th><th>{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th><th>{{ t('mean alpha', '平均阿尔法') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('in top 20%', '位于前20%') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('names', '只') }}</th></tr>
      {% for s in sectors %}
      <tr>
        <td class="rk">{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td>{{ td(s.sector) }}</td>
        <td><div class="scorecell">{{ abar(s.mean) }}<span class="znum band-{{ 'strong' if s.mean>=0.3 else 'lag' if s.mean<-0.3 else 'mid' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(s.mean) }}</span></div></td>
        <td class="r muted sm">{{ s.intop }}/{{ s.n }} · {{ s.pct }}%</td>
        <td class="r muted sm">{{ s.n }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- THEMES OVERVIEW -->
<div id="tab-themes" data-grp="tab" style="display:none">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('Themes by alpha', '按阿尔法排序的主题') }}
      {{ help('Curated narrow thematic baskets ranked by the MEAN sector-neutral alpha-z of their members, with the share sitting in the universe-wide top quintile. Membership is hand-curated (S&P 1500-verified), overlaps GICS sectors, and is CONTEXT — not a buy list. There is no per-theme backtest: hand-picked baskets ranked on a single snapshot would be selection / multiple-testing bias, so this is a current-snapshot lens, not validated alpha.', '人工策划的细分主题篮子，按其成分股的平均板块中性阿尔法 z 排序，并显示位于全域前五分位的占比。成分为人工策划（标普1500内核验）、跨 GICS 板块，仅作背景——非买入清单。无逐主题回测：对人工挑选篮子做单时点排名会带来选择/多重检验偏差，故此为当前快照视角，而非经验证的阿尔法。') }}</h2>
    <p class="muted sm note">{{ t('Context, not a buy list. Themes are curated baskets, not backtested portfolios — they re-aggregate the existing sector-neutral alpha.', '仅作背景，非买入清单。主题为人工策划的篮子，未作组合回测——它们仅对既有的板块中性阿尔法重新聚合。') }}</p>
    <table>
      <tr><th>#</th><th>{{ t('theme', '主题') }}</th><th>{{ t('mean alpha', '平均阿尔法') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('in top 20%', '位于前20%') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('names', '只') }}</th></tr>
      {% for h in themes %}
      <tr>
        <td class="rk">{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td>{{ td(h.theme) }}<div class="muted sm">{% for r in h.names[:7] %}<a href="stock.html#{{ r.ticker }}">{{ r.ticker }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if h.names|length > 7 %} <span class="muted">+{{ h.names|length - 7 }}</span>{% endif %}</div></td>
        <td><div class="scorecell">{{ abar(h.mean) }}<span class="znum band-{{ 'strong' if h.mean>=0.3 else 'lag' if h.mean<-0.3 else 'mid' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(h.mean) }}</span></div></td>
        <td class="r muted sm">{{ h.intop }}/{{ h.n }} · {{ h.pct }}%</td>
        <td class="r muted sm">{{ h.n }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SECTOR INDEX (drill) -->
<div id="tab-sector" data-grp="tab" style="display:none">
  <div class="panel">
    <select id="secsel" class="secsel">
      {% for sec in sector_order %}<option value="{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ sec }} ({{ by_sector[sec].n }})</option>{% endfor %}
    </select>
    {% for sec in sector_order %}
    <div id="sec-{{ loop.index0 }}" data-grp="seclist"{% if not loop.first %} style="display:none"{% endif %}>
      <div class="twocol">
        <div>
          <h3 class="pos">{{ t('Leaders', '领先') }} — {{ td(sec) }}</h3>
          <table>
            <tr><th>#</th><th>{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th><th>{{ t('alpha z', '阿尔法 z') }}</th><th>{{ t('entry', '入场') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('12-1', '12-1') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('RS', '相对强度') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('price', '价格') }}</th></tr>
            {% for r in by_sector[sec].leaders %}{{ srow(r) }}{% endfor %}
          </table>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="neg">{{ t('Laggards', '落后') }} — {{ td(sec) }}</h3>
          <table>
            <tr><th>#</th><th>{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th><th>{{ t('alpha z', '阿尔法 z') }}</th><th>{{ t('entry', '入场') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('12-1', '12-1') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('RS', '相对强度') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('price', '价格') }}</th></tr>
            {% for r in by_sector[sec].laggards %}{{ srow(r) }}{% endfor %}
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted sm note">{{ t('Dual score: alpha z is the GLOBAL sector-neutral rank (comparable across sectors); the # is the IN-SECTOR rank. A name can lead its sector yet sit mid globally, or rank elite globally from a hot sector.', '双重评分：alpha z 是全局板块中性排名（可跨板块比较）；# 为板块内排名。某只股票可能领先其板块却在全局居中，或因身处强势板块而全局领先。') }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:0">{{ t(
    'Source: engine/residual_alpha.py (sector-neutral residual momentum) over the S&P 1500 price universe joined to GICS sectors. Ranks recompute daily with prices. A modest, decayed, crowded edge — research lens, not a buy list. See research/RESIDUAL_ALPHA_MOMENTUM.md and LIMITATIONS.md.',
    '来源：engine/residual_alpha.py（板块中性残差动量），覆盖标普 1500 价格域并连接 GICS 板块。排名随价格每日重算。温和、已衰减、拥挤的边际信号 — 研究视角，而非买入清单。') }}
    {{ t('Generated', '生成于') }} {{ built }}</p>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
 function show(id, grp){ document.querySelectorAll('[data-grp="'+grp+'"]').forEach(function(el){ el.style.display='none'; }); var el=document.getElementById(id); if(el) el.style.display=''; }
 document.querySelectorAll('.tabbtn').forEach(function(b){ b.addEventListener('click', function(){
   document.querySelectorAll('.tabbtn').forEach(function(x){ x.classList.remove('on'); }); this.classList.add('on');
   show('tab-'+this.dataset.tab, 'tab'); }); });
 var su=document.getElementById('seg-strong'), sw=document.getElementById('seg-weak');
 if(su&&sw){ su.addEventListener('click', function(){ su.classList.add('on'); sw.classList.remove('on'); show('g-strong','glist'); });
             sw.addEventListener('click', function(){ sw.classList.add('on'); su.classList.remove('on'); show('g-weak','glist'); }); }
 var sel=document.getElementById('secsel');
 if(sel) sel.addEventListener('change', function(){ show('sec-'+this.value, 'seclist'); });
})();
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
